message.content:
这是根据您的演示大纲生成的第 2 页 HTML 代码，聚焦「活动目标」，用数据卡片和一条边界提示来组织信息。
```html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<style>
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  :root{
    --bg:#F5F2E9; --surface:#F3F0E7;
    --ink:#1B2620; --muted:#5C665D;
    --green:#4F5E43; --gold:#B4914A; --blue:#8C9FB2;
    --line:#A3AC9E;
    --serif:'Bodoni Moda','Noto Serif CJK SC','Songti SC','STSong',Georgia,serif;
    --sans:'Archivo','Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;
  }
  .slide{
    position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--bg);font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink);
  }
  /* ---------- background field ---------- */
  .bg-field{
    position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 2% 0%,rgba(180,145,74,.09),transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(880px 760px at 47% 46%,rgba(140,159,178,.10),transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(950px 760px at 95% 95%,rgba(79,94,67,.10),transparent 72%),
      linear-gradient(168deg,#F8F5EC 0%,#F5F2E9 52%,#EFECE1 100%);
  }
  .bg-field:after{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(27,38,32,.045) 0 1px,transparent 1px 160px);
    opacity:.9;
  }
  .dot-field{
    position:absolute;z-index:1;opacity:.30;
    background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(27,38,32,.45) 1.05px,transparent 1.15px);
    background-size:15px 15px;
  }
  .dot-a{left:1030px;top:770px;width:760px;height:260px;opacity:.18;}
  .dot-b{left:96px;top:676px;width:540px;height:290px;opacity:.16;}
  .prism{
    position:absolute;z-index:1;left:1858px;top:150px;width:390px;height:1150px;
    transform:rotate(15deg);transform-origin:top left;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(140,159,178,.22),rgba(140,159,178,.07) 70%,rgba(140,159,178,0));
  }
  .prism:after{
    content:"";position:absolute;left:86px;top:0;width:60px;height:1150px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.36);
  }
  .gridline{position:absolute;z-index:2;background:rgba(27,38,32,.06);}
  .gl1{left:720px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px;}
  .gl2{left:1292px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px;}
  .top-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:48px;width:1760px;height:1px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.34);}
  .bottom-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:998px;width:1760px;height:1px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.18);}
  .left-rule{position:absolute;left:60px;top:40px;width:1px;height:1000px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.26);}
  .rail-tick{position:absolute;left:54px;width:13px;height:1px;z-index:7;background:rgba(27,38,32,.42);}
  .rail-tick.t1{top:196px;}
  .rail-tick.t2{top:742px;}
  .rail-label{
    position:absolute;left:44px;top:600px;z-index:9;transform:rotate(-90deg);transform-origin:left top;
    font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:5.1px;color:#637067;white-space:nowrap;text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  /* ---------- register ring ---------- */
  .register{position:absolute;right:-70px;top:-80px;width:230px;height:230px;z-index:3;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.30);}
  .register .r2{position:absolute;inset:9px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.18);}
  .register .r3{
    position:absolute;inset:22px;border-radius:50%;
    background:conic-gradient(from 210deg,rgba(79,94,67,.20),rgba(79,94,67,0) 24%,rgba(140,159,178,.30) 50%,rgba(140,159,178,.08) 78%,rgba(79,94,67,.20));
  }
  .register .r4{position:absolute;inset:30px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(245,242,233,.9);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.08);}
  .register .r5{position:absolute;inset:44px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(140,159,178,.24);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.09);}
  .register .dot{position:absolute;left:42px;top:146px;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(180,145,74,.13);}
  /* ---------- top meta ---------- */
  .top-meta{
    position:absolute;left:98px;top:61px;z-index:15;
    font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4.2px;color:#4f5b53;
  }
  /* ---------- lead column ---------- */
  .lead{position:absolute;left:96px;top:158px;width:580px;z-index:10;}
  .eyebrow{
    font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:#8a7040;text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  h1{
    margin:16px 0 0 0;font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:96px;line-height:1.04;
    letter-spacing:2px;color:#1B2620;
  }
  .rule-gold{width:92px;height:3px;background:var(--gold);margin:28px 0 30px 0;}
  .thesis{
    margin:0;font-size:27px;line-height:1.78;font-weight:500;color:#33402f;letter-spacing:.5px;
  }
  .thesis em{
    font-style:normal;color:#2b3a26;font-weight:700;
    border-bottom:2px solid rgba(180,145,74,.65);padding-bottom:2px;
  }
  .boundary{
    margin-top:44px;padding:26px 30px;
    background:rgba(180,145,74,.12);
    border-left:3px solid var(--gold);
  }
  .boundary .b-label{
    font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;color:#8a7040;margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  .boundary p{margin:0;font-size:23px;line-height:1.6;color:#33402f;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.4px;}
  /* ---------- metrics ---------- */
  .metrics{
    position:absolute;left:760px;top:196px;width:1064px;z-index:10;
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-auto-rows:260px;gap:26px;
  }
  .card{
    position:relative;padding:32px 36px 0 40px;
    background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(255,255,255,.62),rgba(253,251,244,.34));
    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);
  }
  .card:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:4px;height:100%;background:var(--c);opacity:.85;}
  .card .idx{
    position:absolute;right:28px;top:28px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2.6px;
    color:rgba(27,38,32,.28);
  }
  .card .k{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;color:#5a655c;}
  .card .v{
    margin-top:18px;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:96px;line-height:1;color:#1B2620;letter-spacing:-1px;
  }
  .card .v .u{
    font-family:var(--sans);font-size:28px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--green);
    margin-left:12px;
  }
  .card .en{
    position:absolute;left:40px;bottom:26px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3.8px;
    color:rgba(27,38,32,.34);text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .c1{--c:#4F5E43;}
  .c2{--c:#B4914A;}
  .c3{--c:#8C9FB2;}
  .c4{--c:#1B2620;}
  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  .note{
    position:absolute;left:96px;bottom:44px;z-index:15;
    font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.6px;color:#6a746b;
  }
  .note span{color:#8a7040;font-weight:700;margin-right:8px;}
  .page-no{
    position:absolute;right:96px;bottom:40px;z-index:15;font-family:var(--serif);
    font-size:22px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#4f5b53;
  }
  .page-no:before{
    content:"";display:inline-block;width:46px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.34);
    vertical-align:middle;margin-right:18px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="slide">
  <div class="bg-field"></div>
  <div class="dot-field dot-a"></div>
  <div class="dot-field dot-b"></div>
  <div class="prism"></div>
  <div class="gridline gl1"></div>
  <div class="gridline gl2"></div>

  <div class="register">
    <div class="r2"></div>
    <div class="r3"></div>
    <div class="r4"></div>
    <div class="r5"></div>
    <div class="dot"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="top-rule"></div>
  <div class="bottom-rule"></div>
  <div class="left-rule"></div>
  <div class="rail-tick t1"></div>
  <div class="rail-tick t2"></div>
  <div class="rail-label">OBJECTIVE · 02</div>

  <div class="top-meta">镜桥产品体验日方案</div>

  <section class="lead">
    <div class="eyebrow">Objective</div>
    <h1>活动目标</h1>
    <div class="rule-gold"></div>
    <p class="thesis">核心目标是收集<em>可观察的使用问题</em></p>
    <div class="boundary">
      <div class="b-label">目标边界</div>
      <p>不承诺成交，不设成交类指标</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="metrics">
    <div class="card c1">
      <div class="idx">01</div>
      <div class="k">邀请名额</div>
      <div class="v">84<span class="u">人</span></div>
      <div class="en">Invitees</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card c2">
      <div class="idx">02</div>
      <div class="k">体验分组</div>
      <div class="v">7<span class="u">组</span></div>
      <div class="en">Groups</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card c3">
      <div class="idx">03</div>
      <div class="k">每组体验时长</div>
      <div class="v">26<span class="u">分钟</span></div>
      <div class="en">Duration</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card c4">
      <div class="idx">04</div>
      <div class="k">反馈问题</div>
      <div class="v">9<span class="u">项</span></div>
      <div class="en">Issues</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="note"><span>注</span>数值引自附件 campaign.pdf，为虚构测评材料中的测试构造值。</div>
  <div class="page-no">2 / 6</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
```
### 活动目标页面的信息层级与视觉设计

- **左栏目标立论**：大标题「活动目标」下方，用加粗下划线的「可观察的使用问题」突出核心指向，黄底卡片明确「不承诺成交，不设成交类指标」。
- **右侧四项指标卡**：84人、7组、26分钟、9项以方格卡片排列，每张卡片用独特的左侧色条区分，让数字和单位一目了然。
- **页面框架**：顶部和底部的细线、左侧竖线以及右上角的装饰圆环构成了背景的秩序感，右下角的「2 / 6」标示当前页码。
